{"created": "2026-10-17T20:15:34.082127+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-17T20:15:34.399804+00:00", "id": 23441617, "conceptrecid": "23441616", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23441616", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "metadata": {"title": "Infinite modulus between a compact real set and its real complement", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "publication_date": "2026-10-17", "description": "<p>For every compact E contained in [0,1], let F be its complement within the real line and let S2 be the circle of radius 2. We prove that positive planar 2-modulus of all curves joining E to S2 forces infinite2-modulus of all curves joining E to F. This answers the explicit implication in the 2018 version of Hayman-Lingham Problem 7.58, including compact sets of zero length and positive capacity. The proof constructs actual boundary values from a pointwise weighted metric, uses critical trace rigidity to force zero length under finite target energy, and then derives a contradiction by small circular connectors. Both global rectifiability and the stated local-off-endpoints convention are treated.</p><p>Classical foundations and independently checked audit-composed deductions from older general theory are acknowledged. No claim of firstness, a new mechanism, an earlier explicitly printed resolution, or current worldwide openness is made. Priority searches are bounded; full 2019 wording and an 1982 talk body remain unauthenticated. The deposit contains the preprint and a portable TeX-source, written-proof, independent-reconstruction, integrity-verification and priority-audit archive. AI tools were used extensively in research, proof development, literature review, internal adversarial verification and writing. This preprint is unrefereed; no external human peer review, journal acceptance or formal proof-assistant certification is claimed.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Kriebel, Alec", "affiliation": "Independent researcher", "orcid": "0009-0001-9320-500X"}], "keywords": ["conformal modulus", "curve families", "critical Sobolev trace", "compact sets", "planar capacity", "Hayman-Lingham Problem 7.58"], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.07200v2", "relation": "references", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/1104.4345", "relation": "references", "scheme": "url"}, {"identifier": "10.1007/BF02386202", "relation": "references", "scheme": "doi"}, {"identifier": "https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/1225", "relation": "isDerivedFrom", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "1.0", "resource_type": {"title": "Preprint", "type": "publication", "subtype": "preprint"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23441616"}}]}}, "title": "Infinite modulus between a compact real set and its real complement", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23441617", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23441617", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23441617?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23441617", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23441617/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23441616", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23441616", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23441616", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.23441616", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23441617/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23441617/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23441617/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23441617/media-files", "thumbnails": {"10": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:23441617:Real_Complement_Modulus_Note_v1.0.pdf/full/%5E1